# Scan Workflow After Code Changes

When modifying any file in src/core/ or src/gui/, follow this validation workflow:

1. Run fast tests: `pytest tests/ -m "not slow" -v` (must pass)
2. Identify which model categories your change affects
3. Run targeted scan: `python scripts/full_scan.py --game all --tier fast --category <affected>`
4. If scan reveals new failures, fix before committing
5. For loader changes: also run `python scripts/full_scan.py --game all --tier modules`

Category flags: creatures, players, npcs, modules, all

Current baseline: 6,224/6,272 match. Any commit that reduces this number is a regression.
